#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
quest — turn any book (a PDF) into a small RPG you play while you read it.

    ./quest add mybook.pdf   build the quest map from the book's table of contents
    ./quest                  dashboard: level, streak, today's goal, what to do next
    ./quest world            the clickable world map (add --ipad to read on an iPad)
    ./quest help             every command

All progress lives in .quest/save.json as an append-only list of events.
XP, levels, streaks and badges are recomputed from those events every time,
so `./quest undo` is always safe. Standard library only (Python 3.8+).
"""
